OL,3,GNEWSAPolice get #2m after spate of
OL,4,Acrimes follows fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force is being given an extra
OL,7,F#2m after a spate of crimes followed
OL,8,Fthe death of two police officers and
OL,9,Ffive men in a head-on crash, the home
OL,10,Fsecretary has announced.
OL,12,FShabana Mahmood pledged the funding
OL,13,Fafter Prime Minister Andy Burnham paid
OL,14,Ftribute to the officers killed, and in
OL,15,Flight of the challenges faced by
OL,16,FCleveland Police following the seven
OL,17,Fdeaths on the A66 near Middlesbrough on
OL,18,F22 August.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
